@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam titleBorderColor #000000
skinparam titleBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam titleBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontStyle bold

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #000000
    ArrowThickness 1.2
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LifeLineBorderColor #000000
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #000000
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BoxBorderColor #000000
    BoxBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    GroupBorderColor #000000
    GroupHeaderFontColor #000000
    GroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    DividerBorderColor #000000
    DividerBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    DividerFontColor #000000
    DividerFontSize 12
    DividerFontStyle bold
}

title Sequence Diagram: Menyesuaikan Perbaikan Kecil (UC-15)

actor "Audio Engineer" as User

box "Presentation Layer (Frontend)"
boundary "Panel Kustomisasi Perbaikan\n(Web UI)" as UI
end box

box "Application & Business Logic Layer (Backend API)"
control "CustomFixController\n(API Gateway)" as FixCtrl
control "AuthMiddleware\n(JWT Guard)" as AuthGuard
entity "CustomFixService\n(Granular Pipeline Core)" as FixSvc
entity "WalletService\n(Token Ledger Core)" as WalletSvc
control "DspRepairWorker\n(Audio DSP Engine)" as DspWorker
end box

box "External Storage / Infrastructure"
control "Cloud Object Storage\n(S3 / MinIO Storage)" as Storage
end box

box "Persistence Layer"
database "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
end box

autonumber 1 "[00]"

== Fase 1: Pemuatan Konfigurasi Modul Rekomendasi ==

User -> UI : Buka tab "Kustomisasi Perbaikan" pada Dasbor Diagnostik
activate User
activate UI

UI -> FixCtrl : GET /api/v1/sessions/{id}/custom-fix/config (Bearer JWT)
activate FixCtrl

FixCtrl -> AuthGuard : validateSession(token)
activate AuthGuard
AuthGuard --> FixCtrl : SessionValid (user_id)
deactivate AuthGuard

FixCtrl -> FixSvc : getRecommendedFixConfig(session_id)
activate FixSvc

FixSvc -> DB : SELECT id, name, instrument, recommended_fixes FROM session_tracks WHERE session_id = ?
activate DB
DB --> FixSvc : Metadata trek & rekomendasi modul DSP standar
deactivate DB

FixSvc --> FixCtrl : ConfigPayload
deactivate FixSvc

FixCtrl --> UI : 200 OK (tracks_config, active_toggles)
deactivate FixCtrl

UI --> User : Render matriks sakelar centang per trek (Phase, Delay, Stereo, DC, Rumble, Gain)
deactivate UI

== Fase 2: Penyetelan Sakelar Modul DSP secara Granular ==

alt Opsi A: Reset ke Rekomendasi Sistem (Alternative Workflow)
  User -> UI : Tekan tombol "Reset ke Rekomendasi Sistem"
  activate UI
  UI -> UI : Pulihkan seluruh centang sakelar sesuai rekomendasi awal sistem
  UI --> User : Perbarui tampilan sakelar default & hitung ulang kebutuhan token
  deactivate UI

else Opsi B: Mengubah Sakelar Perbaikan Selektif per Trek
  User -> UI : Matikan sakelar Auto Gain pada vokal & biarkan Polarity Flip aktif pada snare
  activate UI
  UI -> UI : Kalkulasi estimasi biaya token proporsional (misal: 3 trek bermodul aktif = 3 token)
  UI --> User : Perbarui indikator visual & tampilkan estimasi 3 token
  deactivate UI
end

== Fase 3: Validasi Eksekusi & Pemrosesan DSP Kustom ==

User -> UI : Tekan tombol "Terapkan Perbaikan Terpilih"
activate UI

alt Tidak Ada Modul Perbaikan yang Dipilih (Exceptional Workflow)
  UI -> UI : Validasi lokal: total sakelar aktif == 0
  UI --> User : Tampilkan peringatan: "Tidak ada modul yang dipilih. Aktifkan minimal satu modul"

else Minimal Satu Modul Perbaikan Aktif
  UI -> FixCtrl : POST /api/v1/sessions/{id}/custom-fix/apply (custom_track_configs)
  activate FixCtrl

  FixCtrl -> FixSvc : executeCustomFixPipeline(session_id, user_id, custom_track_configs)
  activate FixSvc

  FixSvc -> WalletSvc : deductTokens(user_id, session_id, token_amount=3)
  activate WalletSvc

  WalletSvc -> DB : UPDATE wallets SET balance = balance - 3 WHERE user_id = ?
  activate DB
  DB --> WalletSvc : BalanceUpdated
  
  WalletSvc -> DB : INSERT INTO token_ledgers (user_id, session_id, type='DEBIT_FIX', amount=-3, description='[Perbaikan Kustom] 3 Trek')
  DB --> WalletSvc : LedgerRecorded
  deactivate DB

  WalletSvc --> FixSvc : PaymentConfirmed
  deactivate WalletSvc

  FixSvc -> DB : UPDATE sessions SET status = 'PROCESSING_CUSTOM_FIX' WHERE id = session_id
  activate DB
  DB --> FixSvc : SessionStatusUpdated
  deactivate DB

  FixSvc -> DspWorker : dispatch(ExecuteSelectiveDspJob(custom_track_configs))
  activate DspWorker
  DspWorker --> FixSvc : JobQueuedInRedis (ws_channel)
  deactivate DspWorker

  FixSvc --> FixCtrl : CustomFixStarted (job_id, ws_channel)
  deactivate FixSvc

  FixCtrl --> UI : 202 Accepted (job_id, ws_channel)
  deactivate FixCtrl

  UI --> User : Tampilkan bilah kemajuan (*progress bar*) rendering kustom real-time

  activate DspWorker
  DspWorker -> Storage : Baca audio mentah dari trek dengan modul aktif
  activate Storage
  Storage --> DspWorker : AudioStream
  deactivate Storage

  DspWorker -> DspWorker : Eksekusi HANYA modul perbaikan yang dicentang (lewati modul nonaktif)
  DspWorker -> Storage : Tulis berkas audio perbaikan kustom
  activate Storage
  Storage --> DspWorker : CustomAudioWritten
  deactivate Storage

  DspWorker -> DB : UPDATE session_tracks SET is_repaired = true, applied_modules = ? WHERE id = ?
  activate DB
  DB --> DspWorker : TracksUpdated
  deactivate DB

  DspWorker --> FixSvc : SelectivePipelineCompleted
  activate FixSvc
  deactivate DspWorker

  FixSvc -> DB : UPDATE sessions SET status = 'CUSTOM_REPAIRED_COMPLETED' WHERE id = session_id
  activate DB
  DB --> FixSvc : SessionCompleted
  deactivate DB

  FixSvc -> UI : WebSocket push: EVENT_CUSTOM_FIX_SUCCESS
  activate UI
  deactivate FixSvc

  UI --> User : Notifikasi sukses perbaikan kustom & buka Pemutar Audio A/B (UC-16)
  deactivate UI
end

deactivate UI
deactivate User

@enduml
